      "status": "current",
      "summary": "Modular Governance Architecture: micro-core protocol (routing, style, checklists, common patterns, intake SOP) decoupled from pluggable domain profiles (validation, architecture, operations); contract-driven assembly via contracts.md."
    },
    {
      "version": "2.1.0",
      "date": "2026-08-24",
      "status": "superseded",
      "summary": "Product validation standard: acceptance.md (journeys), experience_scenarios.md (experiences), and testing.md (implementation) three-tier model."
    },
    {
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "date": "2026-08-23",
      "status": "superseded",
      "summary": "Three routing gates (time, audience, cognitive mode) with root-files exception; repository contracts split from adoption; knowledge-layers page; postmortem workflow in update/review checklists; manifest for drift detection."
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "date": "2026-06-13",
      "status": "superseded",
      "summary": "Flat Diataxis decision list, adoption held repository contracts, common-docs pattern library, AGENTS.md maintainer rule."
    }
  ],
